# Never commit ─────────────────
# 🔴 The .env FAMILY, not just .env. The previous rules covered only
# `.env`, `.env.local` and `.env.*.local`, so `.env.backup`, `.env.old`,
# `.env.prod` — and the `.env.localhost-backup` that a 2026-08-11 pass
# actually created — were all stageable while carrying SESSION_SECRET and
# DATABASE_URL. That near-miss was caught by attention; attention is not a
# control.
# `.env.*` covers the family; the negation re-admits the committed template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# personal overrides — project settings.json IS committed
.claude/settings.local.json
# session-handoff notes — internal agent notes, not project deliverable
.claude/next-task.md

# ── Generated ────────────────────────────────
# graphify knowledge graph — derived data, rebuilt by `graphify update .`
# Committing it churns a large diff on every code change. DEC-037 / ISSUE-019
graphify-out/
# tooling backups of .claude/settings.json — the live file IS committed, so a
# local backup is redundant and must never be staged. ISSUE-036
*.graphify-bak

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Test and coverage ────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Playwright CLI artifacts (DEC-040) — verification sessions only, not a
# test suite; .claude/skills/playwright-cli/ (the skill itself) is NOT ignored
.playwright-cli/
.playwright/

# ── Editors and OS ───────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Prisma ───────────────────────────────────
# migrations ARE committed — only local artefacts are ignored
server/prisma/*.db
server/prisma/*.db-journal

# ── Uploads ──────────────────────────────────
# runtime uploads are not versioned; seed images in assets/ are
uploads/

# ── Python tooling ───────────────────────────
# scripts/measure-image-framing.py's bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
